30,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The developers are busy until the third quarter, and the coordination group is understaffed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, that's worrying. Also, network coverage at customer plants is very unreliable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,"We have room in the software allowance, but the capital budget is frozen.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"It seems tools requiring daily entry from everyone usually fail, while narrow tools survive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We are losing an hour daily to copying records, and misrouted deliveries are happening.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
